 **[Corentin Segalas](https://csegalas.github.io/)** is a postdoctoral researcher in Biostatistics at [Inserm U1219 *Bordeaux Population Health*](https://www.bordeaux-population-health.center/) in the [BIOSTAT team](https://www.bordeaux-population-health.center/the-teams/biostat/) and [SISTM team](https://www.bordeaux-population-health.center/the-teams/sistm/). His research focuses on developing predictive models from longitudinal data using random forests and functional data methods with a focus on cognitive ageing applications.
